An IAM user named iamuser_ravi and a policy named iampolicy_ravi already exist. Attach the IAM policy iampolicy_ravi to the IAM user iamuser_ravi.

1. 
aws-client ~ ➜  
aws iam list-policies --query "Policies[?PolicyName=='iampolicy_ravi'].Arn" --output text
arn:aws:iam::869896128647:policy/iampolicy_ravi

2. 
aws-client ~ ✖ aws iam attach-user-policy --user-name iamuser_ravi --policy-arn arn:aws:iam::869896128647:policy/iampolicy_ravi

3.
aws-client ~ ➜  aws iam list-attached-user-policies --user-name iamuser_ravi
{
    "AttachedPolicies": [
        {
            "PolicyName": "iampolicy_ravi",
            "PolicyArn": "arn:aws:iam::869896128647:policy/iampolicy_ravi"
        }
    ]
